{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01350",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 4.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.3,
      "end_seconds": 9.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.32,
      "end_seconds": 21.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "It's a feeling that I can't take a deep breath, mostly. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.32,
      "end_seconds": 25.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.17,
      "end_seconds": 31.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Mm, I've had it for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.5,
      "end_seconds": 36.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.52,
      "end_seconds": 40.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "It's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.82,
      "end_seconds": 44.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.64,
      "end_seconds": 53.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "It usually comes with tiredness. The tiredness? That's been for three weeks. And, And occasional wheeze, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.74,
      "end_seconds": 59.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Any leg swelling, fever or coughing up blood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.4,
      "end_seconds": 63.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.55,
      "end_seconds": 65.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "What about weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.5,
      "end_seconds": 69.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Not at all, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.19,
      "end_seconds": 74.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.93,
      "end_seconds": 81.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Okay, so nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.23,
      "end_seconds": 102.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.73,
      "end_seconds": 109.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Just my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.6,
      "end_seconds": 114.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.45,
      "end_seconds": 120.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Hmm, I have high blood pressure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.57,
      "end_seconds": 122.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.75,
      "end_seconds": 135.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.59,
      "end_seconds": 141.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.79,
      "end_seconds": 144.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.15,
      "end_seconds": 148.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.82,
      "end_seconds": 150.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.46,
      "end_seconds": 155.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.85,
      "end_seconds": 159.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Okay, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 163.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.6,
      "end_seconds": 168.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.71,
      "end_seconds": 176.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.05,
      "end_seconds": 187.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.01,
      "end_seconds": 203.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.12,
      "end_seconds": 229.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 21, heart rate 102. And saturation 94 percent, pressure 120 over 75, temp 37.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.6,
      "end_seconds": 236.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.18,
      "end_seconds": 239.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.04,
      "end_seconds": 244.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "So, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.4,
      "end_seconds": 253.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.35,
      "end_seconds": 255.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.93,
      "end_seconds": 276.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.91,
      "end_seconds": 290.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.83,
      "end_seconds": 294.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.09,
      "end_seconds": 324.06,
      "duration_seconds": 27.97,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up do well once it's treated properly. We should do an echocardiogram for breathlessness. I'd like to arrange breathing tests for chronic breathlessness. Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. We'll refer you to a chest physician."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.08,
      "end_seconds": 332.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Can you send me for a CT scan of the chest?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.76,
      "end_seconds": 348.54,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "Not at this point, no. It isn't indicated yet. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you after the results are back. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.26,
      "end_seconds": 353.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.16,
      "end_seconds": 355.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}